Jetson Orin Nano (RHEL9.4 bootc host)
│
├── systemd
│   ├── flightctl-agent.service         ── talks to Edge Manager on OCP
│   ├── nvidia-cdi.service              ── regens CDI on boot
│   └── podman (rootful, via quadlets or flightctl-managed)
│
├── Persistent host storage
│   └── /var/lib/mangey-moose/
│       └── models/                     ── shared volume for .pt and .engine
│           ├── yolov8n.pt              ── shipped or downloaded once
│           └── yolov8n.engine          ── built on-device by model-init
│
├── Container: mediamtx                  [ALWAYS ON]
│   ├── Network: host
│   ├── Ports: 8554 (RTSP), 8889 (WHEP), 8888 (HLS)
│   └── Role: receives publisher stream, fans out to viewers
│
├── Container: model-init                [RUN ONCE, then exits]
│   ├── Mounts: /var/lib/mangey-moose/models → /models
│   ├── Devices: nvidia.com/gpu=all
│   └── Role: exports .pt → .engine for this exact GPU/TRT version
│
└── Container: yolo-infer  OR  traffic-infer    [SWAPPABLE, only one at a time]
    ├── Network: host
    ├── Devices: /dev/video0, nvidia.com/gpu=all
    ├── Mounts: /var/lib/mangey-moose/models → /models (read-only)
    └── Role: reads camera, runs inference, publishes to rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/infer